# 🦎 Zig 컴파일러 완전 분해 & 구현 로드맵

**목표**:
- 1차: Zig 컴파일러 구조 완전히 이해하기
- 2차: 자체 Zig 컴파일러 완전 구현하기

**기준**: Zig 0.15+ (self-hosted, Codeberg)

---

## Part 1: 컴파일러 파이프라인 (전체 맵)

```
.zig source code
    ↓
[1] TOKENIZE (Lexing)
    ↓
Token stream
    ↓
[2] PARSE (Parser)
    ↓
AST (Abstract Syntax Tree)
    ↓
[3] ASTGEN (AST → ZIR)
    ↓
ZIR (Zig Intermediate Representation)
    ↓
[4] SEMA (Semantic Analysis)
    ├─ Type checking
    ├─ Comptime interpretation
    ├─ Error set analysis
    ├─ Inline function resolution
    └─ Generic instantiation
    ↓
AIR (Analyzed Intermediate Representation)
    ↓
[5] CODEGEN (Instruction Selection)
    ├─ x86_64
    ├─ aarch64
    ├─ arm
    ├─ wasm
    ├─ c (C code generation)
    └─ llvm (LLVM IR)
    ↓
Machine Code / C Code / LLVM IR
    ↓
[6] LINK (Linker)
    ↓
Executable / Library
```

