```

**핵심 기능** (순서대로):

#### 4.1 Type Checking (기본)
```zig
// ZIR instruction마다 type 결정
fn analyzeInstAdd(self: *Sema, inst: Zir.Inst.Add) !Zir.Ref {
    const lhs_type = try self.resolveType(inst.lhs);
    const rhs_type = try self.resolveType(inst.rhs);

    if (!lhs_type.eql(rhs_type)) {
        return error.TypeMismatch;
    }

    return try self.air.addBinaryOp(lhs_type, inst.tag, inst.lhs, inst.rhs);
}
```

